      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> <strong>Faithful Companion:</strong> cast Find Familiar once per Long Rest without a slot or Material components (activity), or with your slots. <strong>Fortified Familiar:</strong> the familiar gets extra Hit Points equal to twice your character level (added by the module when it appears). <strong>Helpful Friend:</strong> while your familiar is within 5 ft, a check with a proficient skill gets Advantage - Proficiency Bonus times per Long Rest (the module sets it and spends a use only when the roll used it).</p>",
